<!--
  SoccerMod TAB board (custom_hud_layout, driven by the server plugin,
  SoccerModMvpPlugin.TabBoard.cs). Shown while a player holds the scoreboard
  key; opaque and large enough to cover CS2 own scoreboard, which cannot be
  switched off. Same rules as soccermod_menu.xml: no id on the root, only
  Panel and Label, texts as {s:text}, no inline styles. Rows t0..t7 (red,
  left) and c0..c7 (blue, right) get "tr-used" or "tr-empty".
-->
